** Helm commands to get informations
- helm get values <Release_name>
- helm get notes <Release_name>
- helm get hooks <Release-name>
- helm get all <Release-name>

** Overwrite values in helm (using set and values.yaml file)
- helm install <Release-name> <chart-names> --set "VALUES"
- helm install <Release-name> -f values.yaml

** Dry-run 
- helm install  <Release-name> <chart-names> --dry-run
- helm upgrade  <Release-name> <chart-names> --dry-run
- helm uninstall  <Release-name> <chart-names> --dry-run
- helm template  <Release-name> --dry-run

